        "slc_8d3bc139372aedb5df506643cd586f21b0a4908a988198264869478561bcf6b5"
      ],
      "text": "The framework self-describes as 100% metadata-driven, combining metadata-driven design with visual no-code design as a standardized development discipline rather than a free-form scaffold."
    },
